<title>HONG KONG: Commercial Bk seen planning $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bk seen planning $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Bank of Korea is planning to issue a US$100 million floating rate note issue, sources close to the transaction said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>Bankers said they expect the issue to pay an all-in return in the mid-30s.</p>
<p>No more details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
